    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n43324" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εὐάγητος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>,
			<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b>
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εὐᾱγής</span>
			, <i>bright</i>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">φύσιν εὐ</span>.,
			of clouds, <i><span class="en">
				Ar.
				<u>Nu.</u>
				276
			</span></i> (lyr.). (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ᾱ</span>, which
			prohibits the other expl. given by Sch., 
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εὐκίνητος</span>
			. —The sense <i>ductile</i>, from <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἡγέομαι</span>, is very dub.)</div>
